<%#
  Plain f.input, not f.input rendering an f.input_field in a block.

  The block form renders the label and then whatever the block returns, so the field inside it
  never goes through simple_form's input pipeline: no design system classes from the wrapper, no
  aria-required, no aria-invalid, no aria-describedby pointing at its error. The label said
  "Name *" and the input said nothing at all. See design.md.
%>
<%= f.input :name, label: "Name", required: true, autofocus: true %>
<%= f.input :email, label: "E-mail", required: true %>
